-
-Function Attributes
-===================
-
-``hlsl.shader``
----------------
-
-The ``hlsl.shader`` function attribute is a string attribute applied to entry
-functions. The value is the string representation of the shader stage (i.e.
-``compute``, ``pixel``, etc).
